    <h2>What are Payday Loans?</h2>
    <p>
        Payday loans are short-term loans that help individuals cover urgent expenses 
        until their next paycheck. These loans are usually small in amount and easy to access.
    </p>

    <h2>How Payday Loans Work?</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Apply online using a simple form</li>
        <li>Submit basic personal and financial details</li>
        <li>Loan gets approved quickly</li>
        <li>Repay on your next salary date with interest</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Eligibility Criteria</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Must be 18 years or older</li>
        <li>Have a regular source of income</li>
        <li>Valid ID proof</li>
        <li>Active bank account</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Pros</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Fast approval process</li>
        <li>Minimal documentation</li>
        <li>Helpful in emergencies</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Cons</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>High interest rates</li>
        <li>Short repayment period</li>
        <li>Penalty for late payment</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Important Note</h2>
    <p>
        Payday loans should be used responsibly. Always read the terms and conditions carefully before applying.
    </p>

